#: .\templates\delivery.html:295
msgid ""
"As soon as the order is processed, our manager will call you back to confirm"
" the order and clarify details. Please note that if the operator cannot "
"contact you within two days, we will be forced to cancel the order. Delivery"
" within 24 hours from the moment of order confirmation, provided the goods "
"are in stock. Delivery is carried out from 09:00 to 18:00. If you need to "
"make a purchase on the same day, we advise you to check with our manager or "
"come to one of the stores and buy on the spot. Note that the courier waiting"
" time is limited. You can add your wishes for the order in the \"comment\" "
"field. Any information can be obtained by phone"
msgstr ""
"Buyurtma qayta ishlanishi bilanoq menejerimiz buyurtmani tasdiqlash va "
"tafsilotlarni aniqlashtirish uchun sizga qayta qo'ng'iroq qiladi. E'tibor "
"bering, agar operator ikki kun ichida siz bilan bog'lana olmasa, biz "
"buyurtmani bekor qilishga majbur bo'lamiz. Yetkazib berish, mahsulot mavjud "
"bo'lsa, buyurtma tasdiqlangan paytdan boshlab 24 soat ichida amalga "
"oshiriladi. Yetkazib berish 09:00 dan 18:00 gacha bajariladi. Agar xaridni "
"o'sha kuni amalga oshirishingiz kerak bo'lsa, menejerimiz bilan "
"maslahatlashishingizni yoki do'konlarimizdan biriga kelib joyida sotib "
"olishingizni tavsiya qilamiz. E'tibor bering, kuryerning kutish vaqti "
"cheklangan. Buyurtma bo'yicha istaklaringizni \"izoh\" maydoniga "
"qo'shishingiz mumkin. Har qanday ma'lumotni telefon orqali olishingiz mumkin"

#: .\templates\delivery.html:295
msgid ""
"We will answer any questions from 9:00 to 21:00 on all working days. Please "
"note that delivery is carried out within Tashkent."
msgstr ""
"Barcha ish kunlari 9:00 dan 21:00 gacha har qanday savolga javob beramiz. "
"E'tibor bering, yetkazib berish Toshkent shahri doirasida amalga oshiriladi."

#: .\templates\delivery.html:299
msgid "Furniture Lifting"
msgstr "Mebelni ko'tarish"

#: .\templates\delivery.html:300
msgid "Furniture lifting is free of charge!"
msgstr "Mebelni ko'tarish bepul!"

#: .\templates\delivery.html:304
msgid "Delivery in Uzbekistan"
msgstr "O'zbekiston bo'ylab yetkazib berish"

#: .\templates\delivery.html:305
msgid ""
"Free delivery only within Tashkent city. Delivery to regions is negotiated "
"individually."
msgstr ""
"Bepul yetkazib berish faqat Toshkent shahri doirasida. Viloyatlarga yetkazib"
" berish alohida kelishiladi."

#: .\templates\delivery.html:310
msgid ""
"As soon as your order is collected, our managers will definitely contact you"
" to clarify the date of your arrival at the warehouse. Direct order "
"formation takes place within one day and, as a rule, the order can be picked"
" up the very next day."
msgstr ""
"Buyurtmangiz to'planishi bilanoq menejerlarimiz omborga kelish sanangizni "
"aniqlashtirish uchun siz bilan albatta bog'lanadi. Buyurtmani bevosita "
"shakllantirish bir kun ichida amalga oshiriladi va, qoida tariqasida, "
"buyurtmani ertasi kuniyoq olib ketish mumkin."

#: .\templates\delivery.html:314
msgid "In case of questions or comments, feel free to contact us by phone"
msgstr ""
"Savol yoki takliflar bo'lsa, telefon orqali biz bilan bemalol bog'laning"

